  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Argentina - Consultative Councils</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant would support institutional development and capacity building in the area of oversight over public expenditures, specifically the Government of Argentina&apos;s spending on social assistance programs.  The purpose of the Grant would be to review the experience of the Consultative Councils set up by decree 565/02 and identify the main strengths and weakenesses.  A proposal for improvements and changes in the institutional model would be prepared and discussed.</narrative>
  </description>
